   {
    "claim": "Every confirmed failure, and every failure at all, came at ego speed 1.4x with the retimed car at 0.5x speed. The search almost never left that corner: it ran almost nothing at ego speeds below 1.4x and little at car speeds above 0.5x. So this is the only combination shown to fail, not the only one that can.",
